# Optional. The asset pipeline resolves every photograph from the direct
# download URLs recorded in the manifest, so a key is not required.
#
# Supply one only if you want the third fallback strategy in
# `scripts/fetch-assets.mjs` to be available (used when both the direct URL and
# the source page metadata fail — for example behind a restrictive network).
#
# Create a free key at https://www.pexels.com/api/
PEXELS_API_KEY=
